<div class="container editor-page"><a href="/dashboard" class="back-link">← Back to studio</a><div class="editor-heading"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse-dot"></span> REFINE YOUR IDEAS</div><h1>Polish your story<span class="accent-period">.</span></h1><p>Good writing gets better with another pass.</p></div><div class="editor-grid"><form class="edit-post-form editor-form" data-post-id="{{post.id}}" novalidate><div class="field"><label for="post-title">STORY TITLE <span>*</span></label><input id="post-title" type="text" name="post-title" maxlength="150" minlength="3" value="{{post.title}}" required></div><div class="field"><div class="field-heading"><label for="post-content">YOUR STORY <span>*</span></label><span id="word-count">0 words</span></div><textarea id="post-content" name="post-content" rows="16" minlength="10" maxlength="50000" required>{{post.description}}</textarea></div><p class="form-message" role="alert" hidden></p><div class="editor-actions"><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Save changes ↗</button><a class="button button-quiet" href="/posts/{{post.id}}">View story</a></div></form><aside class="editor-sidebar"><span class="overline">STORY SETTINGS</span><div class="tip-block"><span>✳</span><div><h3>Already published</h3><p>Changes will be reflected immediately on the public story.</p></div></div><a href="/posts/{{post.id}}" class="button button-outline button-block">Open published story ↗</a><hr><h3 class="danger-title">Danger zone</h3><p>Deleting a story also removes its discussion. This cannot be undone.</p><button class="button button-danger delete-post-btn button-block" type="button" data-post-id="{{post.id}}">Delete this story</button></aside></div></div><script src="/js/editPost.js"></script><script src="/js/deletePost.js"></script><script src="/js/editor.js"></script>